# Optional. Without a key the app still works: retention plans come from a deterministic
# playbook built from the model's own what-if results. With a key, Gemini writes the wording
# of the outreach text (it is given the model's numbers and told not to invent any).
# Copy this file to .env and replace the placeholder.
GEMINI_API_KEY="MY_GEMINI_API_KEY"

# Optional. Without a key the "Ask AI" panel reports itself unavailable; nothing else is
# affected. With a key, questions about a customer or the portfolio are answered by Claude
# calling real tools over the model's own outputs - it never invents a number itself.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=""
# Optional, defaults to claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929.
CHURN_AI_MODEL=""
